{"id":"5bdf9b99211ed117","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-hyp.md","title":"超算术集与超算术归约","display":"df-hyp — 超算术集与超算术归约","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-hyp","aliases":["43-df-hyp"],"display":"df-hyp — 超算术集与超算术归约","depends_on":["[[43-df-infseq]]","[[43-df-sigma11]]","[[43-df-pi11]]"],"source_edition":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖","source_locator":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu §2; https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf","verification_status":"formalization-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-hyp"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-hyp</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyp — 超算术集与超算术归约"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" href=\"?note=fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" title=\"43-df-sigma11\">43-df-sigma11</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"书外补充；用户所供2007稿未涵盖"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"External: Chong–Nies–Yu §2; <a href=\"https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">https://www.cs.auckland.ac.nz/~nies/papers_till_09/ChongNiesYu_LownessHigherRandomness.pdf</a>"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"formalization-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AsSet}\">\\(\\operatorname{AsSet}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"565c3258eee2a5ff\" href=\"?note=565c3258eee2a5ff\" title=\"43-df-infseq\">43-df-infseq</a>，有效解析与余解析类见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" href=\"?note=fd20d0fb1ced54f7\" title=\"43-df-sigma11\">43-df-sigma11</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"689c9916fcffb575\" href=\"?note=689c9916fcffb575\" title=\"43-df-pi11\">43-df-pi11</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}\">\\(\\mathrm{HYP}\\)</span> 是自然数集合的类；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le_h\">\\(\\le_h\\)</span> 同时接受集合及特征序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\cap\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\cap\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HYP}\\coloneqq\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{HYP}\\coloneqq\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\le_h B\\iff\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\in\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\le_h B\\iff\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\in\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega)\\cap\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega)\\cap\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>超算术集合类保持为自然数集合的类，归约则显式把集合或序列参数转为自然数集合。由此 Π¹₁ 随机点上的超算术归约可直接使用序列参数，无需依赖正文外的同一识别约定。该节点只给定义，不附加关于归约的等价定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-infseq]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigma11","status":"resolved","id":"fd20d0fb1ced54f7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-sigma11]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-pi11]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-infseq","status":"resolved","id":"565c3258eee2a5ff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，有效解析与余解析类见 [[43-df-sigma11]]、[[43-df-pi11]]。$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 是自然数集合的类；$\\le_h$ 同时接受集合及特征序列。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-sigma11","status":"resolved","id":"fd20d0fb1ced54f7","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，有效解析与余解析类见 [[43-df-sigma11]]、[[43-df-pi11]]。$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 是自然数集合的类；$\\le_h$ 同时接受集合及特征序列。","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-pi11","status":"resolved","id":"689c9916fcffb575","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega$；$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]，有效解析与余解析类见 [[43-df-sigma11]]、[[43-df-pi11]]。$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 是自然数集合的类；$\\le_h$ 同时接受集合及特征序列。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N)\\cup2^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{AsSet}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HYP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le_h","display":false},{"tex":"\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(B)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B))\\cap\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HYP}\\coloneqq\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\varnothing).","display":true},{"tex":"A\\le_h B\\iff\\operatorname{AsSet}(A)\\in\\Delta^1_{1,\\mathbb N}(\\operatorname{AsSet}(B)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Delta^1_1(2^\\omega)\\coloneqq\\Sigma^1_1(2^\\omega)\\cap\\Pi^1_1(2^\\omega).","display":true}],"bytes":1580,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-505","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-hyp]] — 超算术集与超算术归约"},{"id":"14ba796cf8a3bf76","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$；$\\Pi^1_1\\mathrm{Random}$ 见 [[43-df-pi11random]]，$\\mathrm{HYP}$ 见 [[43-df-hyp]]，$\\operatorname{AsSet}$ 见 [[43-df-infseq]]。"},{"id":"6bacc140319ebf3e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$X\\in2^\\omega$，$O\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$O\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}$ 且 $\\forall B\\in\\Pi^1_{1,\\mathbb N}\\,\\exists g\\in\\mathbb N^{\\mathbb N}[\\mathrm{Computable}(g)\\land\\forall n(n\\in B\\leftrightarrow g(n)\\in O)]$。$O$ 可取 Kleene 的 $\\mathcal O$；断言只用已给出的完整性假设。$\\le_h$ 见 [[43-df-hyp]]。"}],"outgoing":["565c3258eee2a5ff","fd20d0fb1ced54f7","689c9916fcffb575"]}